(7735068, 1275048, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition in a difficult location and a great character shot. Love the angle, love the subject and the choice of black and white. But I absolutely hate the filter used... I''m sorry. I''m not the most old-skool here but it just doesn''t look real or sincere. If a film look is desired less is more for sure. The whole image is a little over-cooked in that sense. But man am I jealous of the shot itself. I''d love to see it revisited with a different edit. Not necessarily much more different, just more natural.<br/> <br/>EDIT Revisiting this... I''ve never liked in a place where the laundromat is part of daily life, but I have used one from time to time and if sitting there alone waiting for the cycle to finish is anything like waiting in a doctor''s surgery or similar then I actually do kind of get that some may get a kind of peaceful stillness in waiting, especially as it''s a regular chore. I''l going to judge this based on the photo itself so I''m bumping up my score as per my previous comment.</td>', 'This is a great composition in a difficult location and a great character shot. Love the angle, love the subject and the choice of black and white. But I absolutely hate the filter used... I''m sorry. I''m not the most old-skool here but it just doesn''t look real or sincere. If a film look is desired less is more for sure. The whole image is a little over-cooked in that sense. But man am I jealous of the shot itself. I''d love to see it revisited with a different edit. Not necessarily much more different, just more natural. EDIT Revisiting this... I''ve never liked in a place where the laundromat is part of daily life, but I have used one from time to time and if sitting there alone waiting for the cycle to finish is anything like waiting in a doctor''s surgery or similar then I actually do kind of get that some may get a kind of peaceful stillness in waiting, especially as it''s a regular chore. I''l going to judge this based on the photo itself so I''m bumping up my score as per my previous comment.', '2022-12-20 07:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735069, 1274915, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting sky with the different layers working down. I''m not sure it fits the challenge so well as it isn''t giving me that ''stillness'' vibe with the tracks of what looks like a boat across the water and the sun moving down in the sky. Beautiful shot though, I''m sure it was great to see in real life.<br/> <br/>EDIT Revisiting this challenge and I am bumping this up a little as I imagine watching a sunset like this has a certain peace to it.</td>', 'This is an interesting sky with the different layers working down. I''m not sure it fits the challenge so well as it isn''t giving me that ''stillness'' vibe with the tracks of what looks like a boat across the water and the sun moving down in the sky. Beautiful shot though, I''m sure it was great to see in real life. EDIT Revisiting this challenge and I am bumping this up a little as I imagine watching a sunset like this has a certain peace to it.', '2022-12-20 07:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
