(7735542, 1275001, 7810, '<td valign="top"><br/>This is a beauty Christmas present !!!<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone who viewed voted and especially commented on my trees.<br/> <br/>I was driving from a job and encountered this crazy fog. I have been away from shooting regularly so it was ''challenge''  to overcome inertia and <br/>actually get in the headspace of shooting. All of a sudden I saw this stand of snow covered trees. I initially drove by thinking to myself that looked really cool.<br/> <br/>I went about a km past and said F it, and did a quick u turn.  I am so glad I went back.  There was snow drizzle and deafening  silence ... really beautiful.<br/> <br/>DPC has had some obvious changes over the years, but its spirit and the challenging of ones creative juices is still the same.<br/>And I can tell you, it is just as exciting at the rollover last nite, as it was so many years ago.<br/> <br/>Thanks again to all :D</td>', 'This is a beauty Christmas present !!! Thanks to everyone who viewed voted and especially commented on my trees. I was driving from a job and encountered this crazy fog. I have been away from shooting regularly so it was ''challenge''  to overcome inertia and actually get in the headspace of shooting. All of a sudden I saw this stand of snow covered trees. I initially drove by thinking to myself that looked really cool. I went about a km past and said F it, and did a quick u turn.  I am so glad I went back.  There was snow drizzle and deafening  silence ... really beautiful. DPC has had some obvious changes over the years, but its spirit and the challenging of ones creative juices is still the same.And I can tell you, it is just as exciting at the rollover last nite, as it was so many years ago. Thanks again to all :D', '2022-12-26 12:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
